Installation:	Copy the whole directory to your "pfiles:"

				pfiles:Top/Top
				pfiles:Top/Top.ansi

				You must start it as a CNet C program.

				Amiga Int'l is enough :)

Starting:		#2pfiles:top/top 2}
                                  ^----- the level needed to see the top ten
